[en.FOCUS_C18_011_TRADE_FLOWER]
Flower Market

[en.FOCUS_C18_011_TRADE_FLOWER_desc]
After the opening up, Kirins deeply realized the gap between themselves and the outside world — the dazzling array of goods from Las Pegasus are pouring in, and the high prices bankrupt many Kirins. The price of one most advanced steam engine is enough to cost an ordinary Kirin the harvest of ten years’ work. A traditional agricultural country such as ours is not benefiting in the international market.\nHowever, in this trade frenzy, one product that stands out has caught our attention: the foal’s breath. The wealthy centaur nobles have regarded these flowers as a symbol of showing off their status, and even put them up for auction, scrambling to empty their wallets to get a few of the freshest foal’s breath.

[zh.FOCUS_C18_011_TRADE_FLOWER]
花卉市场

[zh.FOCUS_C18_011_TRADE_FLOWER_desc]
开放后的麒麟深刻认识到了自己与外界的差距——洛马基琳琅满目的商品涌入，高昂的价格让许多麒麟望而却步，一台最先进的蒸汽机的价格足以花费普通麒麟十年劳作的收成。一个传统农耕的国度，在国际市场中并不吃香。\n但在这贸易狂潮中，一项表现亮眼的商品引起了我们的注意：稚马之息。富裕的半人马贵族们俨然将这些花卉视作炫耀身份的象征，甚至将它们放上了拍卖会，抢破脑袋掏空钱包也要抢到几枝最新鲜的稚马之息。

